<title>UK: BOE forecasts 1.55 bln stg shortage, offers help.</title>
<headline>BOE forecasts 1.55 bln stg shortage, offers help.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England offered the UK money market an early round of assistance after forecasting a liquidity shortage of around 1.55 billion stg.</p>
<p>The operations will comprise repos to June 16 and 17, and outright offers of bills maturing on or before June 17.</p>
</text>
